{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"tim-heidecker","name":"Tim Heidecker","birthDate":"1976-02-03","birthPlace":"Allentown, Pennsylvania, USA","bio":"Timothy Richard Heidecker (born February 3, 1976) is an American comedian, writer, director, actor, and musician. Along with Eric Wareheim, he is a member of the comedy duo Tim & Eric.\n\nHe has also appeared in films, including Bridesmaids (2011), Tim and Eric's Billion Dollar Movie (2012), The Comedy (2012), Ant-Man and the Wasp (2018), and Us (2019). He currently co-hosts the parodic film review web series On Cinema and stars in the comedy series Decker alongside Gregg Turkington and hosts a weekly call-in show, Office Hours Live with Tim Heidecker, with DJ Douggpound and Vic Berger.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Tim Heidecker, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:25:46+00:00","tmdbId":132856,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/132856","credits":[{"id":"antman-wasp","title":"Ant-Man and the Wasp","character":"Whale Boat Captain Daniel Goobler"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/tim-heidecker.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Lizard Music","year":2027,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"Full Phil","year":2026,"character":"Chad","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yHiCY08iWt15PiEaQX1lBSwm1Ze.jpg"},{"name":"The 13th Annual On Cinema Oscar Special","year":2026,"character":"New Amato","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/p2RPu6zTVqUkMtEosfW6mreCCaY.jpg"},{"name":"Strip Law","year":2026,"character":"(voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hs9kjF67nO5vc3kBgm3IF2MLnRe.jpg"},{"name":"Regular Show: The Lost Tapes","year":2026,"character":"Talks (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jqY3dj70ffSqKpM8XVUEToOEeLG.jpg"},{"name":"HIM","year":2025,"character":"Tom","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.